    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "maybe. but the darkness isn't just a flaw, it feels like a debt. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who doesn't belong here. like i'm a parasite on everything around me. i feel like if i just disappeared, the world wouldn't even notice the difference, it might actually be better off without the weight of me. do you think it's possible that some people just aren't meant to stay?",
